{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33756","headline":"正乐府十篇 农父谣 · 皮日休","name":"正乐府十篇 农父谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"农父冤辛苦，向我述其情。\n难将一人农，可备十人征。\n如何江淮粟，挽漕输咸京。\n黄河水如电，一半沈与倾。\n均输利其事，职司安敢评。\n三川岂不农，三辅岂不耕。\n奚不车其粟，用以供天兵。\n美哉农父言，何计达王程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33756.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33756","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}